350/extras/2a842a3e5a670fd7a639e75d90eb6e31.poster.avif?t=1724346129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343350/extras/2a842a3e5a670fd7a639e75d90eb6e31.webm?t=1724346129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343350/extras/2a842a3e5a670fd7a639e75d90eb6e31.mp4?t=1724346129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Guard\uff1aThousands of monsters will launch a general attack at the end, and you need to use the collected materials to fight them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343350/extras/58fc8130d537828b76677261e4be5e5c.poster.avif?t=1724346129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343350/extras/58fc8130d537828b76677261e4be5e5c.webm?t=1724346129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343350/extras/58fc8130d537828b76677261e4be5e5c.mp4?t=1724346129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Weather\uff1aA changeable and random weather system, each weather that is randomly and dynamically switched will have an important impact on the game process.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343350/extras/61644dec09ceb3db3eee3684e6819c6e.poster.avif?t=1724346129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343350/extras/61644dec09ceb3db3eee3684e6819c6e.webm?t=1724346129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343350/extras/61644dec09ceb3db3eee3684e6819c6e.mp4?t=1724346129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
